Z||000000||Cozmo||10-14-2001||03:28 AM||||I ain't Mr. Grammar or anything, but it sure does seem the quality of the posts lately has been terrible.<BR>I mean, a little attention to proper spelling and punctuation would be appreciated...<BR><B>And keep the profanity to yourself.</B><BR>Sorry if I sound a little angry, but last night I "showed off" the Forum to a new Fiero convert and to be honest I was a little ashamed at the quality of the content.<BR>We have more class than that...<P>BobC||||reg||10
