Z||000009||Archie||10-14-2001||10:52 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Master_Sushi:<BR><B>.... You also see strage abbreavations that arn't used anywhere else!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">. As long as people understand what you trying to get across who cares.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well I care & so do many others. <P>I'm not the best speller in the world. I usually ignore posts where the profanity,  spelling errors or grammar are as bad as your example above.<P>I see that you are a student.... You ask "As long as people understand what you trying to get across who cares." I would think that a student would already know the answer to that question.<P>I recall someone who posted up a few weeks ago. In his post he claimed to be a 3rd. year Journalism Major at UCLA. Well, in my book, he lost a lot of creditability in that post. You see in that post, while he was bragging about how smart he was he miss-spelled several words including "College" & "Journalism". So, either that guy was lying or his parents have been spending a lot of money just to get him out of the house.<P>I know.... it shouldn't really matter "As long as people understand what you trying to get across", but it does matter. Leaving a good First Impression always matters. <P>Archie  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||9
