Z||000014||Mach10||10-14-2001||08:20 PM||||I agree and disagree.<P>In archie's case, he is running a business, some of which at least originates on this forum. As such, a professional demeanor is crucial. <P>For the rest of us slobs, though, it doesn't matter a bit. True, it'd be nice for *some* of the posts to tidy up, but I don't see it as an overwhelming issue at this point. The "s**t I need help" post was a little over the top, but I'm not personally offended. He's frustrated. But yes, it'd be nicer to see some more courtesy to the more sensitive members  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||6
