Z||000021||Sootah||10-14-2001||11:53 PM||||Hmm. Point taken. I punctuate, a lot. More than I should I think. Case in point; I try to make it so that when you read it, it sounds like I would have said it. Pauses and all. Spelling bugs me if I have a typo or something; However, if I don't have any idea how to I'll just wing it and hope for the best.<P>As for the profanity, I should cool it (Can't get too angry at me for it, I bought a car and threw a rod on the way home! You'd be a bit flustered yourself!). You will notice though I did warn the others in the title of my thread that there would be some. Perhaps I will go back and censor myself some...<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sootah__Nuclear_Happy_Face_Sig.jpg">     <BR><sup><I>Never pull your pants down in Cosco, the dang monkeys will getcha</I></sup> <BR><sup><B>AIM</B>: KSSouter</sup>||||reg||14
