Z||000028||Sage||10-15-2001||08:37 AM||||Pet peeves:<P>1) Run on sentences.<BR>2) Proper use of:<BR>-------------------------------------<BR>A) There-in that place; at that place<BR>B) Their-of them; belonging to them<BR>C) They're-they are<P>A) To-in the direction of<BR>B) Too-also<BR>C) Two-2<P>There are others, but these seem to be the most abused.  Typos are inevitable, and I'm no English major, but when a post is difficult to understand because of spelling, grammar or misuse of terminology, it ceases to be relevant IMHO.  Thanks Cliff for adding spell check!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Have a good one!||||reg||1
